<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">

<title>Grafik Fungsi Trigonometri Lainnya</title>
<metadata>
  <md:content-id>m49389</md:content-id>
  <md:title>Grafik Fungsi Trigonometri Lainnya</md:title>
  <md:abstract><para id="para-00001">Dalam bagian ini, Anda akan:</para>
    <list id="list-00001"><item>Menganalisis grafik  y=tan x.</item>
    <item>Menggambar variasi  y=tan x.</item>
    <item>Menganalisis grafik  y=sec x  dan  y=csc x.</item>
    <item>Menggambar variasi  y=sec x  dan  y=csc x.</item>
    <item>Menganalisis grafik  y=cot x.</item>
    <item>Menggambar variasi  y=cot x.</item></list></md:abstract>
  <md:uuid>cb7bac04-92bc-42cc-962f-4698fdaaab60</md:uuid>
</metadata>

<content>
<para id="fs-id1420477">Kita mengetahui bahwa fungsi tangen dapat digunakan untuk mencari jarak, misalnya tinggi gedung, gunung, atau tiang bendera. Namun, bagaimana jika kita ingin mengukur kejadian berulang dari suatu jarak? Bayangkan, misalnya, sebuah mobil pemadam kebakaran yang diparkir di samping gudang. Lampu berputar pada mobil itu akan menyapu dinding gudang secara berkala. Jika masukannya adalah waktu, keluarannya adalah jarak yang ditempuh berkas cahaya. Berkas cahaya akan menempuh pola jarak yang berulang secara berkala. Fungsi tangen dapat digunakan untuk menghampiri jarak ini. Ketika berkas sejajar dengan dinding, asimtot diperlukan untuk menggambarkan siklus berulang tersebut karena berkas seolah-olah dapat memanjang tanpa batas. Grafik fungsi tangen memperlihatkan interval-interval berulang itu dengan jelas. Pada bagian ini, kita akan mempelajari grafik fungsi tangen dan fungsi trigonometri lainnya.</para><section id="fs-id1321556"><title>Menganalisis Grafik <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> = tan <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis></title><para id="fs-id1530665">Kita akan mulai dengan menggambar grafik fungsi <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00001">tangen</term>, dengan memplot titik-titik seperti pada fungsi sinus dan kosinus. Ingatlah bahwa</para>
<equation id="fs-id1614888" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </equation><para id="fs-id1288893"> <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00002">periode</term> fungsi tangen adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>π</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> karena grafik berulang pada interval <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mi>π</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>k</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> adalah sebuah konstanta. Jika kita membuat grafik fungsi tangen pada <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> hingga <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> kita dapat melihat perilaku grafik dalam satu siklus penuh. Jika kita melihat interval yang lebih besar, kita akan melihat bahwa karakteristik grafik berulang.</para>
<para id="fs-id1647294">Kita dapat menentukan apakah tangen merupakan fungsi ganjil atau genap dengan menggunakan definisi tangen.</para>
<equation id="fs-id1615402" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtable>
       <m:mtr>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable><m:mtext>Definisi tangen</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>             </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.5em" />
<m:mi>x</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtable>
       <m:mtr>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable><m:mtext>Sinus adalah fungsi ganjil, kosinus adalah fungsi genap</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>             </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtable>
       <m:mtr>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable><m:mtext>Hasil bagi fungsi ganjil dan genap adalah ganjil</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>             </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtable>
       <m:mtr>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
        <m:mtd>
         <m:mrow />
        </m:mtd>
       </m:mtr>

      </m:mtable><m:mtext>Definisi tangen</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id1460636">Oleh karena itu, tangen merupakan fungsi ganjil. Kita dapat menganalisis lebih lanjut perilaku grafis fungsi tangen dengan melihat nilai beberapa sudut istimewa, seperti yang tercantum dalam <link target-id="Table_06_02_00" />.</para><table id="Table_06_02_00" summary="Dua baris dan 10 kolom. Baris pertama berlabel x dan baris kedua berlabel tangen x. Pasangan terurut nilai-nilai kolom pada tabel adalah: (-pi/2, tidak terdefinisi), (-pi/3, negatif akar kuadrat 3), (-pi/4, -1), (-pi/6, negatif akar kuadrat 3 per 3), (0, 0), (pi/6, akar kuadrat 3 per 3), (pi/4, 1), (pi/3, akar kuadrat 3), (pi/2, tidak terdefinisi).">
<tgroup cols="10"><colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" />
<colspec colnum="4" colname="c4" />
<colspec colnum="5" colname="c5" />
<colspec colnum="6" colname="c6" />
<colspec colnum="7" colname="c7" />
<colspec colnum="8" colname="c8" />
<colspec colnum="9" colname="c9" />
<colspec colnum="10" colname="c10" />
<tbody>
<row>
<entry align="center"><emphasis> <m:math>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:math> </emphasis></entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>6</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center">0</entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>6</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry align="center"><emphasis> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </emphasis></entry>
<entry align="center">tidak terdefinisi</entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:msqrt>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center">–1</entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msqrt>
     <m:mn>3</m:mn>
    </m:msqrt>

   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center">0</entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:msqrt>
     <m:mn>3</m:mn>
    </m:msqrt>

   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center">1</entry>
<entry align="center"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:msqrt>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:msqrt>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </entry>
<entry align="center">tidak terdefinisi</entry>
</row>
</tbody>



</tgroup>
</table><para id="fs-id1279869">Titik-titik ini membantu kita menggambar grafik, tetapi kita perlu menentukan perilakunya di tempat fungsi tidak terdefinisi. Jika kita mencermati nilai-nilai ketika <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> kita dapat menggunakan tabel untuk mencari kecenderungannya. Karena <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mn>1.05</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mn>1.57</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> kita akan mengevaluasi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> pada ukuran radian <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mn>1.05</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>1.57</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> seperti yang ditunjukkan pada <link target-id="Table_06_02_01" />.</para>


 <table id="Table_06_02_01" summary="Dua baris dan lima kolom. Baris pertama berlabel x dan baris kedua berlabel tangen x. Pasangan terurut nilai-nilai kolom pada tabel adalah: (1.3, 3.6), (1.5, 14.1), (1.55, 48.1), (1.56, 92.6).">
<tgroup cols="5"><colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" />
<colspec colnum="4" colname="c4" />
<colspec colnum="5" colname="c5" />
<tbody>
<row>
<entry align="center"><emphasis> <m:math>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:math> </emphasis></entry>
<entry align="center">1.3</entry>
<entry align="center">1.5</entry>
<entry align="center">1.55</entry>
<entry align="center">1.56</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry align="center"><emphasis> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</emphasis></entry>
<entry align="center">3.6</entry>
<entry align="center">14.1</entry>
<entry align="center">48.1</entry>
<entry align="center">92.6</entry>
</row>
</tbody>




</tgroup>
</table><para id="fs-id1658883">Ketika <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> mendekat <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> keluaran fungsi menjadi semakin besar. Karena <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> merupakan fungsi ganjil, tabel nilai negatif yang bersesuaian ditunjukkan pada <link target-id="Table_06_02_02" />.</para><table id="Table_06_02_02" summary="Dua baris dan lima kolom. Baris pertama berlabel x dan baris kedua berlabel tangen x. Pasangan terurut nilai-nilai kolom pada tabel adalah: (-1.3, -3.6), (-1.5, -14.1), (-1.55, -48.1), (-1.56, -92.6).">
<tgroup cols="5"><colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" />
<colspec colnum="4" colname="c4" />
<colspec colnum="5" colname="c5" />
<tbody>
<row>
<entry align="center"><emphasis> <m:math>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi>
</m:math> </emphasis></entry>
<entry align="center">−1.3</entry>
<entry align="center">−1.5</entry>
<entry align="center">−1.55</entry>
<entry align="center">−1.56</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry align="center"><emphasis> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </emphasis></entry>
<entry align="center">−3.6</entry>
<entry align="center">−14.1</entry>
<entry align="center">−48.1</entry>
<entry align="center">−92.6</entry>
</row>
</tbody>


</tgroup>
</table><para id="fs-id1318044">Kita dapat melihat bahwa, ketika <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> mendekat <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> keluarannya menjadi semakin kecil. Ingatlah bahwa ada nilai-nilai <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> yang membuat <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Misalnya, <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Pada nilai ini, <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00003">fungsi tangen</term> tidak terdefinisi, sehingga grafik <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> memiliki diskontinuitas pada <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mtext> dan </m:mtext><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Pada nilai ini, grafik tangen memiliki asimtot vertikal. <link target-id="Figure_06_02_001" /> mewakili grafik <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Tangen bernilai positif dari 0 hingga <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan dari <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>π</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> hingga <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> sesuai dengan kuadran I dan III lingkaran satuan.</para><figure id="Figure_06_02_001" class="small">
<media id="fs-id1081768" alt="Grafik y=tangen x. Asimtot pada -pi dibagi 2 dan pi dibagi 2.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_001.jpg" />
</media>
 <caption>Grafik fungsi tangen</caption>
</figure>
</section><section id="fs-id1678025"><title>Variasi Grafik dari <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> = tan <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis></title><para id="fs-id1232225">Seperti halnya fungsi sinus dan kosinus, <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00004">tangen</term> dapat dijelaskan dengan persamaan umum.</para><equation id="fs-id988668" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </equation><para id="fs-id1393080">Kita dapat mengidentifikasi regangan dan pemampatan horizontal dan vertikal menggunakan nilai <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>A</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:math> Peregangan horizontal biasanya dapat ditentukan dari periode grafik. Pada grafik tangen, peregangan vertikal sering perlu ditentukan menggunakan sebuah titik pada grafik.</para><para id="fs-id933588">Karena fungsi tangen tidak memiliki nilai maksimum atau minimum, istilah <emphasis effect="italics">amplitudo</emphasis> tidak dapat ditafsirkan dengan cara yang sama seperti pada fungsi sinus dan kosinus. Sebagai gantinya, kita akan menggunakan istilah <emphasis effect="italics">faktor peregangan/pemampatan</emphasis> ketika mengacu pada konstanta <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para>

<note id="fs-id1409849"><label>Catatan Umum</label><title>Fitur Grafik <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> = <emphasis effect="italics">A</emphasis>tan(<emphasis effect="italics">Bx</emphasis>)</title>
<list id="fs-id1300606" list-type="bulleted"><item>Faktor peregangannya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Periodenya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>P</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Domainnya adalah semua bilangan real <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> sedemikian sehingga <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>k</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>  adalah bilangan bulat.</item>
<item>Range-nya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>−∞</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>∞</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Asimtotnya muncul pada <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>k</m:mi></m:mrow>
</m:math>  adalah bilangan bulat.</item>
<item> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> adalah fungsi ganjil.</item>
</list></note><section id="fs-id1430247"><title>Membuat Grafik Satu Periode Fungsi Tangen yang Diregangkan atau Dimampatkan</title><para id="fs-id1698843">Kita dapat menggunakan sifat-sifat <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00005">fungsi tangen</term> untuk dengan cepat membuat sketsa grafik fungsi tangen yang diregangkan dan/atau dimampatkan dalam bentuk <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Kita memusatkan perhatian pada satu <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00006">periode</term> dari fungsi yang mencakup titik asal, karena sifat periodiknya memungkinkan kita memperluas grafik ke seluruh domain fungsi jika diinginkan. Domain terbatas yang kita gunakan adalah interval <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>P</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>P</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan grafiknya memiliki asimtot vertikal di <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mo>±</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>P</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>P</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mi>B</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Pada <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> grafik akan muncul dari asimtot kiri di <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> melintasi titik asal, dan terus meningkat saat mendekati asimtot kanan di <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Untuk membuat fungsi mendekati asimtot pada laju yang benar, kita juga perlu mengatur skala vertikal dengan benar-benar mengevaluasi fungsi tersebut untuk setidaknya satu titik yang akan dilewati grafik. Misalnya kita bisa menggunakan</para><equation id="fs-id1631239" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>P</m:mi>
     <m:mn>4</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>P</m:mi>
     <m:mn>4</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>B</m:mi>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </equation>
<para id="fs-id1638091">karena <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>4</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1.</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para>

<note id="fs-id1644376" class="how-to-notitle">
<label>Petunjuk</label>
<para id="fs-id917405"><emphasis>Jika diberikan fungsi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> gambarkan satu periodenya.</emphasis></para><list id="fs-id1270463" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic"><item>Tentukan faktor peregangan, <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Tentukan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>B</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan tentukan periodenya, <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>P</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Gambarlah asimtot vertikal di <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>P</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>P</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Untuk <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> grafik mendekati asimtot kiri pada nilai keluaran negatif dan asimtot kanan pada nilai keluaran positif (berlaku sebaliknya untuk <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> ).</item>
<item>Plotkan titik-titik acuan pada <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>P</m:mi>
     <m:mn>4</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>P</m:mi>
     <m:mn>4</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mo>,−</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan gambarkan grafik melalui titik-titik ini.</item>
</list></note>

<example id="Example_06_02_01">
<exercise id="fs-id1426111"><problem id="fs-id1678052">
<title>Membuat Sketsa Tangen yang Dimampatkan</title>
<para id="fs-id1316312">Buatlah sketsa grafik satu periode fungsi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.5</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1316279">
<para id="fs-id1051354">Pertama, kita identifikasi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>A</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para>


<media id="fs-id1654424" alt="Ilustrasi persamaan yang menunjukkan bahwa A adalah koefisien tangen dan B adalah koefisien x yang berada dalam fungsi tangen.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_002.jpg" />
</media>

<para id="fs-id1701807">Karena <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.5</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> kita dapat menentukan <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00007">faktor peregangan/pemampatan</term> dan periodenya. Periodenya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> jadi asimtotnya ada di <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:mn>1.</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Pada seperempat periode dari titik asal, diperoleh</para>
<equation id="fs-id1061460" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0.5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.5</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>0.5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.5</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>4</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.5</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><para id="fs-id1644467">Artinya kurva harus melalui titik-titik tersebut <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>0.5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>0.5</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>−0.5</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Satu-satunya titik belok ada di titik asal. <link target-id="Figure_06_02_003" /> menunjukkan grafik satu periode fungsi.</para><figure id="Figure_06_02_003" class="small">
<media id="fs-id864145" alt="Grafik satu periode dari fungsi tangen yang dimodifikasi, dengan asimtot di x=-1 dan x=1.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_003.jpg" />
</media>
</figure>
</solution>
</exercise></example>

<note id="fs-id1009376" class="precalculus try">
<label>Coba</label>
<exercise id="ti_06_02_02"><problem id="fs-id1706988"><para id="fs-id1706989">Buat sketsa grafik <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>6</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1354903">
<media id="fs-id1439999" alt="Grafik dua periode fungsi tangen yang dimodifikasi, dengan asimtot di x=-3 dan x=3.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_004.jpg" />
</media>
</solution></exercise></note>
</section><section id="fs-id1464435"><title>Membuat Grafik Satu Periode dari Fungsi Tangen Bergeser </title><para id="fs-id1406087">Sekarang kita dapat menggambar <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00008">fungsi tangen</term> yang diregangkan atau dimampatkan, lalu menambahkan pergeseran vertikal dan/atau horizontal (fase). Dalam hal ini, kita menambahkan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>C</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>D</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> ke bentuk umum fungsi tangen.</para><equation id="fs-id1270990" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </equation><para id="fs-id1241838">Grafik fungsi tangen yang ditransformasi berbeda dengan fungsi tangen dasar <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dalam beberapa cara:</para>
<note id="eip-87"><title>Fitur Grafik <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> = <emphasis effect="italics">A</emphasis>tan(<emphasis effect="italics">Bx</emphasis>−<emphasis effect="italics">C</emphasis>)+<emphasis effect="italics">D</emphasis></title><list id="fs-id1346106" list-type="bulleted"><item>Faktor peregangannya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Periodenya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</item>
<item>Domainnya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>C</m:mi>
   <m:mi>B</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>k</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>  adalah bilangan bulat.</item>
<item>Range-nya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>−∞</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>∞</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</item>
<item>Asimtot vertikal terjadi pada <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>C</m:mi>
   <m:mi>B</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>k</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>  adalah bilangan bulat ganjil.
</item>
<item>Tidak ada amplitudo.</item>
</list></note><note id="fs-id1665485" class="how-to-notitle">
<label>Petunjuk</label>
<para id="fs-id1432077"><emphasis>Jika diberikan fungsi <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> gambarkan satu periodenya.</emphasis></para><list id="fs-id1459436" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic"><item>Nyatakan fungsi yang diberikan dalam bentuk <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Tentukan <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00009">faktor peregangan/pemampatan</term>, <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Tentukan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>B</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan tentukan periodenya, <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>P</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Tentukan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>C</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan tentukan pergeseran fase, <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>C</m:mi>
   <m:mi>B</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Gambarlah grafik <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> bergeser ke kanan sebesar <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>C</m:mi>
   <m:mi>B</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan ke atas sebesar <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Buatlah sketsa asimtot vertikal yang muncul pada <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>C</m:mi>
   <m:mi>B</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>  adalah bilangan bulat ganjil.</item>
<item>Plotkan tiga titik acuan mana pun dan gambarlah grafik yang melalui titik-titik tersebut.</item>
</list></note>

<example id="Example_06_02_02"><exercise id="fs-id1677226">
    <problem id="fs-id1663685">
        <title>Membuat Grafik Satu Periode dari Fungsi Tangen Bergeser</title>
        <para id="fs-id1355894">Gambarkan satu periode fungsi <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>−2</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mn>−1.</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> </para></problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1519791">
        <list id="eip-id1165133446963" list-type="labeled-item"><item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 1.</emphasis> Fungsi tersebut sudah ditulis dalam bentuk <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> </item>
        <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 2.</emphasis> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>−2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> sehingga faktor peregangannya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2.</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
        <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 3.</emphasis> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> jadi periodenya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>P</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1.</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>         </item>
        <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 4.</emphasis> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>C</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> jadi pergeseran fasenya adalah <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>C</m:mi>
                    <m:mi>B</m:mi>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>−1.</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> </item>
        <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 5-7.</emphasis> Asimtotnya ada di <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> dan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mn>1</m:mn>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> dan tiga titik referensi yang direkomendasikan adalah <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>−1.25</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
                <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>−1,</m:mn><m:mn>−1</m:mn>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> dan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>−0.75,</m:mn><m:mn>−3</m:mn>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> Grafiknya ditunjukkan pada <link target-id="Figure_06_02_005" />.
            <figure id="Figure_06_02_005" class="small">
            <media id="fs-id1306930" alt="Grafik satu periode fungsi tangen yang digeser, dengan asimtot vertikal pada x=-1.5 dan x=-0.5.">
                <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_005.jpg" />
            </media>
            </figure>
        </item>
            </list></solution>
    <commentary id="fs-id1700370">
        <title>Analisis </title>
        <para id="fs-id1456051">Perhatikan bahwa ini adalah fungsi menurun karena <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>0.</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> </para></commentary>
</exercise>
</example><note id="fs-id1586707" class="precalculus try">
<label>Coba</label>
<exercise id="ti_06_02_03">
 <problem id="fs-id1379854"><para id="fs-id1379856">Bagaimana tampilan grafik pada <link target-id="Example_06_02_02" /> akan berbeda jika kita menetapkan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> alih-alih <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mn>−2</m:mn><m:mo>?</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1394905"><para id="fs-id1394906">Grafik akan dicerminkan terhadap garis <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> menjadi fungsi yang meningkat.</para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>

<note id="fs-id672550" class="how-to-notitle">
<label>Petunjuk</label>
<para id="fs-id1422588"><emphasis>Dengan grafik fungsi tangen yang diberikan, tentukan peregangan horizontal dan vertikalnya.</emphasis></para>
<list id="fs-id1586539" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic">
<item>Tentukan periode <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>P</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dari jarak antara asimtot vertikal yang berurutan atau titik potong sumbu <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>.</item>
<item>Tulis <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mi>P</m:mi>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Tentukan sebuah titik yang mudah digunakan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> pada grafik yang diberikan dan gunakan untuk menentukan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
</list>
</note>

<example id="Example_06_02_03"><exercise id="fs-id1430636">
<problem id="fs-id1430638">
<title>Mengidentifikasi Grafik Tangen yang Diregangkan</title>
 <para id="fs-id1586016">Temukan rumus untuk fungsi yang digambarkan dalam grafik <link target-id="Figure_06_02_006" />.</para>

<figure id="Figure_06_02_006" class="small">
<media id="fs-id1459219" alt="Grafik dua periode fungsi tangen yang dimodifikasi, dengan asimtot di x=-4 dan x=4.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_006.jpg" />
</media>
 <caption>fungsi tangen yang diregangkan</caption>
</figure>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1649012">
<para id="fs-id1649014">Grafik tersebut berbentuk seperti fungsi tangen. </para>
<list id="eip-id1165134188910" list-type="labeled-item"><item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 1.</emphasis> Satu siklus berlangsung dari –4 hingga 4, jadi periodenya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>P</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>8.</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Karena <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>P</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> kita punya <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mi>P</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>8</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 2.</emphasis> Persamaannya harus berbentuk <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>8</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>

<item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 3.</emphasis> Untuk mencari peregangan vertikal <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> kita dapat menggunakan titik <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
<equation id="fs-id638950" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>8</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mo>⋅</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>4</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </equation></item>
</list><para id="fs-id1536654">Karena <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>4</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2.</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para>
<para id="fs-id1409295">Fungsi ini akan memiliki rumus <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>8</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example><note id="fs-id1655580" class="precalculus try">
<label>Coba</label>
<exercise id="ti_06_02_04">
 <problem id="fs-id1563795"><para id="fs-id1563796">Temukan rumus fungsi di <link target-id="Figure_06_02_007" />.</para>
<figure id="Figure_06_02_007" class="small">
<media id="fs-id1692621" alt="Grafik empat periode fungsi tangen yang dimodifikasi, asimtot vertikal pada -3pi/4, -pi/4, pi/4, dan 3pi/4.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_007.jpg" />
</media>
</figure>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1582990"><para id="fs-id1662824"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section></section><section id="fs-id1653007"><title>Menganalisis Grafik <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> = sec <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> dan <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> = csc<emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis></title><para id="fs-id1405395"> <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00010">sekan</term> didefinisikan melalui <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00011">identitas resiprokal</term> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Perhatikan bahwa fungsinya tidak terdefinisi ketika kosinusnya adalah 0, sehingga menghasilkan asimtot vertikal pada <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan seterusnya. Karena nilai absolut kosinus tidak pernah melebihi 1, nilai absolut sekan, sebagai resiprokalnya, tidak pernah kurang dari 1.</para><para id="fs-id1615608">Kita dapat membuat grafik <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan mengamati grafik fungsi kosinus karena kedua fungsi tersebut saling resiprokal. Lihat <link target-id="Figure_06_02_008" />. Grafik kosinus ditampilkan sebagai gelombang oranye putus-putus agar hubungannya terlihat. Ketika grafik fungsi kosinus menurun, grafik <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00012">fungsi sekan</term> meningkat. Ketika grafik fungsi kosinus meningkat, grafik fungsi sekan menurun. Ketika fungsi kosinus bernilai nol, sekan tidak terdefinisi.</para><para id="fs-id1657904">Grafik sekan memiliki asimtot vertikal pada setiap nilai <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> saat grafik kosinus memotong sumbu <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>; asimtot tersebut ditampilkan pada grafik di bawah sebagai garis vertikal putus-putus, tetapi selanjutnya tidak semua asimtot pada grafik sekan dan kosekan ditampilkan secara eksplisit.</para><para id="fs-id1457737">Perhatikan bahwa, karena kosinus merupakan fungsi genap, sekan juga merupakan fungsi genap. Artinya, <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para><figure id="Figure_06_02_008" class="small">
<media id="fs-id1705176" alt="Grafik kosinus x dan sekan x. Asimtot sekan x ditunjukkan pada -3pi/2, -pi/2, pi/2, dan 3pi/2.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_008.jpg" />
</media>
<caption>Grafik fungsi sekan, <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </caption>
</figure>
<para id="fs-id1584466">Seperti yang kita lakukan untuk fungsi tangen, kita akan mengacu lagi pada konstanta <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> sebagai faktor peregangan, bukan amplitudo.</para><note id="fs-id1700128"><label>Catatan Umum</label><title>Fitur Grafik <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> = <emphasis effect="italics">A</emphasis>sec(<emphasis effect="italics">Bx</emphasis>)</title>

<list id="fs-id1440349" list-type="bulleted"><item>Faktor peregangannya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Periodenya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Domainnya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>k</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>  adalah bilangan bulat ganjil.</item>
<item>Range-nya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>∞</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo><m:mo>∪</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>∞</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Asimtot vertikal terjadi pada <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>k</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>  adalah bilangan bulat ganjil.</item>
<item>Tidak ada amplitudo.</item>
<item> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> merupakan fungsi genap karena kosinus merupakan fungsi genap.</item>
</list></note><para id="fs-id1380717">Seperti halnya sekan, fungsi <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00013">kosekan</term> ditentukan oleh identitas resiprokal <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> Perhatikan bahwa fungsi tersebut tidak terdefinisi ketika sinusnya adalah 0, yang menyebabkan asimtot vertikal pada grafik di <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan seterusnya. Karena nilai absolut sinus tidak pernah melebihi 1, nilai absolut kosekan, sebagai resiprokalnya, tidak pernah kurang dari 1.</para><para id="fs-id1413697">Kita dapat membuat grafik <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan mengamati grafik fungsi sinus karena kedua fungsi tersebut saling resiprokal. Lihat <link target-id="Figure_06_02_009" />. Grafik sinus ditampilkan sebagai gelombang oranye putus-putus agar hubungannya terlihat. Ketika grafik fungsi sinus menurun, grafik <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00014">fungsi kosekan</term> meningkat. Ketika grafik fungsi sinus meningkat, grafik fungsi kosekan menurun.</para><para id="fs-id1380921">Grafik kosekan memiliki asimtot vertikal pada setiap nilai <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> saat grafik sinus memotong sumbu <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>; asimtot tersebut ditampilkan pada grafik di bawah sebagai garis vertikal putus-putus.</para><para id="fs-id1457402">Perhatikan bahwa, karena sinus merupakan fungsi ganjil, maka fungsi kosekan juga merupakan fungsi ganjil. Artinya, <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>−csc</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para><para id="eip-610">Grafik kosekan yang ditunjukkan pada <link target-id="Figure_06_02_009" />, serupa dengan grafik sekan.</para><figure id="Figure_06_02_009" class="small">
<media id="fs-id1678069" alt="Grafik kosekan x dan sinus x. Lima asimtot vertikal ditunjukkan pada kelipatan pi.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_009.jpg" />
</media>
<caption>Grafik fungsi kosekan, <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>

 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </caption>
</figure>

<note id="fs-id1683902"><label>Catatan Umum</label><title>Fitur Grafik <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> = <emphasis effect="italics">A</emphasis>csc(<emphasis effect="italics">Bx</emphasis>)</title>

<list id="fs-id1425299" list-type="bulleted"><item>Faktor peregangannya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Periodenya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Domainnya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>k</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>  adalah bilangan bulat.</item>
<item>Range-nya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>∞</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>∪</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>∞</m:mi>
  </m:mrow> <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Asimtotnya muncul pada <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>k</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>  adalah bilangan bulat.</item>
<item> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> merupakan fungsi ganjil karena sinus merupakan fungsi ganjil.</item>
</list></note></section><section id="fs-id1670966"><title>Variasi Grafik dari <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> = sec <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> dan <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis>= csc <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis></title><para id="fs-id1420053">Untuk versi fungsi sekan dan kosekan yang digeser, dimampatkan, dan/atau diregangkan, kita dapat mengikuti metode yang serupa dengan metode untuk tangen dan kotangen. Kita menentukan letak asimtot vertikal dan mengevaluasi fungsi di beberapa titik, khususnya titik-titik ekstrem lokal. Jika hanya satu periode yang akan digambar, interval periodenya dapat dipilih dengan lebih dari satu cara. Prosedur untuk sekan sangat serupa, karena identitas kofungsi menyatakan bahwa grafik sekan sama dengan grafik kosekan yang digeser setengah periode ke kiri. Pergeseran vertikal dan pergeseran fase dapat diterapkan pada <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00015">fungsi kosekan</term> dengan cara yang sama seperti untuk fungsi sekan dan fungsi lainnya. Persamaannya menjadi sebagai berikut.</para>
<equation id="eip-341" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
  </m:mrow>
 <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi>
</m:math>
</equation>
<equation id="eip-134" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
  </m:mrow>
 <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi>
</m:math>
</equation><note id="eip-992"><label>Catatan Umum</label><title>Fitur Grafik <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> = <emphasis effect="italics">A</emphasis>sec(<emphasis effect="italics">Bx</emphasis>−<emphasis effect="italics">C</emphasis>)+<emphasis effect="italics">D</emphasis></title>
<list id="eip-id2701214"><item>Faktor peregangannya adalah <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Periodenya adalah <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Domainnya adalah <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>C</m:mi>
                <m:mi>B</m:mi>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dengan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>k</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>  adalah bilangan bulat ganjil.</item>
    <item>Range-nya adalah <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>∞</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo><m:mo>∪</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>∞</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Asimtot vertikal terjadi pada <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>C</m:mi>
                <m:mi>B</m:mi>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dengan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>k</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>  adalah bilangan bulat ganjil.</item>
<item>Tidak ada amplitudo.</item>
    <item> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>-</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math> merupakan fungsi genap karena kosinus merupakan fungsi genap.</item>
</list></note><note id="eip-439"><label>Catatan Umum</label><title>Fitur Grafik  <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> = <emphasis effect="italics">A</emphasis>csc(<emphasis effect="italics">Bx</emphasis>−<emphasis effect="italics">C</emphasis>)+<emphasis effect="italics">D</emphasis></title>
<list id="eip-id1449110"><item>Faktor peregangannya adalah <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Periodenya adalah <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Domainnya adalah <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>C</m:mi>
                <m:mi>B</m:mi>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dengan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>k</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>  adalah bilangan bulat.</item>
    <item>Range-nya adalah <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>∞</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo><m:mo>∪</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>∞</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Asimtot vertikal terjadi pada <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>C</m:mi>
   <m:mi>B</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mo>|</m:mo><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mo>|</m:mo>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>k</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>  adalah bilangan bulat.</item>
<item>Tidak ada amplitudo.</item>
    <item> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>-</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math> merupakan fungsi ganjil karena sinus merupakan fungsi ganjil.</item>
</list></note><note id="fs-id1420056" class="how-to-notitle">
<label>Petunjuk</label>
<para id="fs-id1512502"><emphasis>Jika diberikan fungsi berbentuk <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> gambarkan satu periodenya.</emphasis></para><list id="fs-id1690218" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic"><item>Nyatakan fungsi yang diberikan dalam bentuk <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Tentukan faktor peregangan/pemampatan, <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Tentukan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>B</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan tentukan periodenya, <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>P</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Gambarlah grafik <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Gunakan hubungan resiprokal antara <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> untuk menggambar grafik <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Buatlah sketsa asimtotnya.</item>
<item>Plotkan dua titik acuan mana pun dan gambarlah grafik yang melalui titik-titik tersebut.</item>
</list></note>

<example id="Example_06_02_04"><exercise id="fs-id1698723">
    <problem id="fs-id1406755">
        <title>Membuat Grafik Variasi Fungsi Sekan</title>
        <para id="fs-id1325018">Gambarkan satu periode <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2.5</m:mn><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0.4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> </para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1426151">
        <list id="eip-id1165135426343" list-type="labeled-item"><item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 1.</emphasis> Fungsi yang diberikan sudah ditulis dalam bentuk umum, <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> </item>
       <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 2.</emphasis> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2.5</m:mn>            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> sehingga faktor peregangannya adalah <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mtext>2</m:mtext><m:mtext>.5</m:mtext><m:mtext>.</m:mtext>
            </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </item>
        <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 3.</emphasis> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.4</m:mn>            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> jadi <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>P</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>0.4</m:mn>
                    </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> Periodenya adalah <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> unit.</item>
        <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 4.</emphasis> Buat sketsa grafik fungsi <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2.5</m:mn><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0.4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> </item>
        <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 5.</emphasis> Gunakan hubungan resiprokal fungsi kosinus dan sekan untuk menggambar fungsi sekan.</item>
        <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 6–7.</emphasis> Buat sketsa dua asimtot di <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1.25</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> dan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3.75</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> Kita dapat menggunakan dua titik referensi, minimum lokal di <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>2.5</m:mn>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> dan maksimum lokal pada <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>2.5</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>−2.5</m:mn>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> <link target-id="Figure_06_02_010" /> menunjukkan grafik.
            <figure id="Figure_06_02_010" class="small">
            <media id="fs-id1674156" alt="Grafik satu periode fungsi sekan yang dimodifikasi, menyerupai parabola terbuka ke atas dan parabola terbuka ke bawah.">
                <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_010.jpg" />
            </media>
            </figure>
        </item>
        </list></solution>
</exercise>
</example><note id="fs-id1439628" class="precalculus try">
<label>Coba</label>
<exercise id="ti_06_02_05"><problem id="fs-id1690764"><para id="fs-id1354617">Gambarkan satu periode <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2.5</m:mn><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>0.4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1440113"><para id="fs-id1440114">Ini merupakan refleksi vertikal dari grafik sebelumnya karena <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>A</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> negatif.</para>
<media id="fs-id1380832" alt="Grafik satu periode fungsi sekan yang dimodifikasi, menyerupai parabola terbuka ke bawah dan parabola terbuka ke atas.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_011.jpg" />
</media>
</solution></exercise></note>

<note id="fs-id1570004" class="precalculus qa">
<label>Tanya Jawab</label>
<para id="fs-id1440136"><emphasis>Apakah pergeseran vertikal dan peregangan/pemampatan memengaruhi range sekan?</emphasis></para><para id="fs-id1420221"><emphasis effect="italics">Ya. Range </emphasis> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> <emphasis effect="italics"> adalah </emphasis> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>∞</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi>
  </m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>∪</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
   <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>∞</m:mi>
  </m:mrow> <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para></note>

<note id="fs-id1638418" class="how-to-notitle"><label>Petunjuk</label>
<para id="fs-id1609961"><emphasis>Jika diberikan fungsi berbentuk <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> gambarkan satu periodenya.</emphasis></para><list id="eip-id2515230" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic"><item>Nyatakan fungsi yang diberikan dalam bentuk <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Tentukan faktor peregangan/pemampatan, <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Tentukan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dan tentukan periodenya, <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Tentukan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>C</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dan tentukan pergeseran fase, <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>C</m:mi>
                <m:mi>B</m:mi>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Gambarlah grafik <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>, tapi geser ke kanan sebesar <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>C</m:mi>
                <m:mi>B</m:mi>
            </m:mfrac>

        </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dan ke atas sebesar <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Buatlah sketsa asimtot vertikal yang muncul pada <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>C</m:mi>
                <m:mi>B</m:mi>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dengan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>k</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>  adalah bilangan bulat ganjil.</item>
</list></note><example id="Example_06_02_05">
<exercise id="fs-id1431671">
<problem id="fs-id1431673">
<title>Membuat Grafik Variasi Fungsi Sekan</title>
<para id="fs-id1537180">Gambarkan satu periode <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>3</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>

   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1.</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1673164">
<list id="fs-id1906405" list-type="labeled-item"><item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 1.</emphasis> Nyatakan fungsi yang diberikan dalam bentuk <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                    <m:mfrac>
                        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                    </m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    </m:mfrac>

                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1.</m:mn>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 2.</emphasis> Faktor peregangan/pemampatannya adalah <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
            <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4.</m:mn>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>  </item>
    <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 3.</emphasis> Periodenya adalah
        <equation id="fs-id2071183" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>|</m:mo><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mo>|</m:mo>
       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>      </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>⋅</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>      </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></item>
    <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 4.</emphasis> pergeseran fase adalah
        <equation id="fs-id2341189" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mtable columnalign="left">
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>C</m:mi>
       <m:mi>B</m:mi>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>

       </m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>   </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>⋅</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
      </m:mfrac>

     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>
   <m:mtr columnalign="left">
    <m:mtd columnalign="left">
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mtext>   </m:mtext><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1.5</m:mn>
     </m:mrow>
    </m:mtd>
   </m:mtr>

  </m:mtable>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation></item>
    <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 5.</emphasis> Gambarlah grafik <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math> tapi geser ke kanan sebesar <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>C</m:mi>
                <m:mi>B</m:mi>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1.5</m:mn>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dan ke atas sebesar <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1.</m:mn>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 6.</emphasis> Buat sketsa asimtot vertikal yang muncul di <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>6.</m:mn>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math> Ada minimum lokal di <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>1.5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dan maksimum lokal pada <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>4.5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math> <link target-id="Figure_06_02_012" /> menunjukkan grafik.



    </item>
</list><figure id="Figure_06_02_012" class="small">
<media id="fs-id1679337" alt="Grafik f(x) menunjukkan dua cabang yang dipisahkan oleh asimtot vertikal pada x=0, x=3, dan x=6. Cabang kiri memiliki minimum lokal pada (1.5, 5), sedangkan cabang kanan memiliki maksimum lokal pada (4.5, -4).">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_012.jpg" />
</media>
</figure>
</solution>

</exercise>
</example>

<note id="fs-id1451968" class="precalculus try">
<label>Coba</label>
<exercise id="ti_06_02_06"><problem id="fs-id1346086"><para id="fs-id1410617">Gambarkan satu periode <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8.</m:mn>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1439474">

<media id="fs-id1673799" alt="Grafik satu periode dari fungsi sekan yang dimodifikasi. Ada dua asimtot vertikal, satu pada kira-kira x=-pi/20 dan satu lagi kira-kira pada 3pi/16.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_013.jpg" />
</media>
</solution>
</exercise></note>

<note id="fs-id1523838" class="precalculus qa"><label>Tanya Jawab</label>
<para id="eip-id1165135487331"><emphasis>Domain <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dinyatakan sebagai semua <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> sedemikian sehingga <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mi>π</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> untuk setiap bilangan bulat <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> <emphasis>Apakah domain </emphasis> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mtext>adalah</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>C</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mi>B</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>?</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </emphasis></para><para id="fs-id1374943"><emphasis effect="italics">Ya. Titik-titik yang dikecualikan dari domain mengikuti asimtot vertikal. Letaknya menunjukkan pergeseran horizontal dan pemampatan atau peregangan yang dihasilkan oleh transformasi pada masukan fungsi asal.</emphasis></para>
</note><note id="fs-id1428931" class="how-to-notitle">
<label>Petunjuk</label>
<para id="fs-id1629286"><emphasis>Jika diberikan fungsi berbentuk <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> gambarkan satu periodenya.</emphasis></para><list id="fs-id1395174" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic"><item>Nyatakan fungsi yang diberikan dalam bentuk <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Tentukan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>B</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan tentukan periodenya, <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>P</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Gambarlah grafik <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Gunakan hubungan resiprokal antara <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> untuk menggambar grafik <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>
<item>Buatlah sketsa asimtotnya.</item>
<item>Plotkan dua titik acuan mana pun dan gambarlah grafik yang melalui titik-titik tersebut.</item>
</list></note>

<example id="Example_06_02_06"><exercise id="fs-id1410488"><problem id="fs-id1410490">
    <title>Membuat Grafik Variasi Fungsi Kosekan</title>
    <para id="fs-id1425806">Gambarkan satu periode <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>−3</m:mn><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </para>
</problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1436222">
        <list id="eip-id1165131907381" list-type="labeled-item"><item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 1.</emphasis> Fungsi yang diberikan sudah ditulis dalam bentuk umum, <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:math>
           </item>
            <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 2.</emphasis> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
            </m:math> sehingga faktor peregangannya adalah 3.</item>
            <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 3.</emphasis> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:math> jadi <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>P</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:math> Periodenya adalah <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                </m:mrow>
        </m:math> satuan.</item>
            <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 4.</emphasis> Buat sketsa grafik fungsi <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>−3</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:math>
                </item>
            <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 5.</emphasis> Gunakan hubungan resiprokal fungsi sinus dan kosekan untuk menggambar <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00016">fungsi kosekan</term>.</item>
            <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 6–7.</emphasis> Buat sketsa tiga asimtot di <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:math> dan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:math> Kita dapat menggunakan dua titik referensi, maksimum lokal di <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                            <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                            <m:mn>8</m:mn>
                        </m:mfrac>
                        <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>−3</m:mn></m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        </m:math> dan minimum lokal pada <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                            <m:mrow>
                                <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>8</m:mn>
                        </m:mfrac>
                        <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:math> <link target-id="Figure_06_02_023" /> menunjukkan grafik.

        <figure id="Figure_06_02_023" class="small">
            <media id="fs-id1601380" alt="Grafik satu periode fungsi kosekan. Ada asimtot vertikal di x=0, x=pi/4, dan x=pi/2.">
                <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_023.jpg" />
            </media>
        </figure>
            </item>
            </list></solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id1714936" class="precalculus try">
<label>Coba</label>
<exercise id="ti_06_02_07"><problem id="fs-id1422180"><para id="fs-id1422181">Gambarkan satu periode <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.5</m:mn><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:math>
 </para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1150397">
  <media id="fs-id1696881" alt="Grafik satu periode fungsi sekan yang dimodifikasi, menyerupai parabola terbuka ke bawah dan parabola terbuka ke atas.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_023b.jpg" />
</media>
 </solution></exercise></note>

<note id="fs-id978295" class="how-to-notitle"><label>Petunjuk</label>
 <para id="fs-id1046161"><emphasis>Jika diberikan fungsi berbentuk <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi></m:mrow>
     <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
 </m:math> gambarkan satu periodenya.</emphasis></para><list id="eip-id1453973" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic"><item>Nyatakan fungsi yang diberikan dalam bentuk <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Tentukan faktor peregangan/pemampatan, <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Tentukan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dan tentukan periodenya, <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
                <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Tentukan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>C</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dan tentukan pergeseran fase, <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>C</m:mi>
                <m:mi>B</m:mi>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Gambarlah grafik <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math> tapi geser ke kanan sebesar <m:math><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>C</m:mi>
                <m:mi>B</m:mi>
            </m:mfrac></m:math> dan ke atas sebesar <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</item>
    <item>Buatlah sketsa asimtot vertikal yang muncul pada <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>C</m:mi>
                <m:mi>B</m:mi>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dengan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>k</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>  adalah bilangan bulat.</item>
</list></note><example id="Example_06_02_07"><exercise id="fs-id1439464">
    <problem id="fs-id1439466">
        <title>Membuat Grafik Kosekan yang Diregangkan Vertikal, Dimampatkan Horizontal, dan Digeser Vertikal</title>
        <para id="fs-id1107734">Buat sketsa grafik <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                            <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:mfrac>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1.</m:mn></m:mrow>
        </m:math> Apa domain dan range fungsi ini?</para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1436082">
        <list id="eip-id3155416" list-type="labeled-item"><item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 1.</emphasis>  Nyatakan fungsi yang diberikan dalam bentuk <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                <m:mrow>
                    <m:mfrac>
                        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    </m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                </m:mrow>
                <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1.</m:mn>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 2.</emphasis>  Tentukan faktor peregangan/pemampatan, <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2.</m:mn>
        </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </item>
        <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 3.</emphasis>  Periodenya adalah <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
                    </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                            <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:mfrac>

                    </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>1</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>⋅</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4.</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </item>
        <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 4.</emphasis>  pergeseran fasenya adalah <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mn>0</m:mn>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                            <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:mfrac>

                    </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0.</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </item>
        <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 5.</emphasis>  Gambarlah grafik <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>            </m:mrow>
        </m:math> tetapi geser ke atas sebesar <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1.</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </item>
        <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 6.</emphasis>  Buat sketsa asimtot vertikal yang muncul di <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4.</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </item>
</list><para id="fs-id869117">Grafik untuk fungsi ini ditunjukkan pada <link target-id="Figure_06_02_014" />.</para>

        <figure id="Figure_06_02_014" class="small"><media id="fs-id1425312" alt="Grafik 3 periode fungsi kosekan yang dimodifikasi, dengan 3 asimtot vertikal dan sebuah fungsi sinusoidal putus-putus. Maksimum lokal fungsi sinusoidal berimpit dengan minimum lokal fungsi kosekan, sedangkan minimum lokal fungsi sinusoidal berimpit dengan maksimum lokal fungsi kosekan.">
                <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_014F.jpg" />
            </media>

        <caption>Fungsi kosekan yang ditransformasikan</caption></figure></solution>
    <commentary id="fs-id1520970">
        <title>Analisis </title>
        <para id="fs-id728453">Asimtot vertikal yang ditunjukkan pada grafik menandai satu periode fungsi, dan ekstrem lokal dalam interval ini ditunjukkan dengan titik. Perhatikan bagaimana grafik kosekan yang ditransformasi berhubungan dengan grafik <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                            <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:mfrac>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:math> ditampilkan sebagai gelombang putus-putus berwarna oranye.</para></commentary>
</exercise>
</example><note id="fs-id1588757" class="precalculus try">
<label>Coba</label>
<exercise id="ti_06_02_08"><problem id="fs-id1464306"><para id="fs-id1464307">Jika diberikan grafik <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>π</m:mi>
      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
     </m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
 </m:math> yang ditunjukkan pada <link target-id="Figure_06_02_015" />, buat sketsa grafik <m:math>
  <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
    <m:mrow>
     <m:mfrac>
      <m:mi>π</m:mi>
      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
     </m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
 </m:math> pada sumbu yang sama.</para>

<figure id="Figure_06_02_015" class="small"><media id="fs-id1457171" alt="Grafik dua periode dari fungsi kosinus yang dimodifikasi. Rentangnya adalah [-1,3], digambarkan dari x=-4 hingga x=4.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_015.jpg" />
</media>

</figure></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1528623"><media id="fs-id1662489" alt="Grafik dua periode fungsi sekan dan kosinus. Grafik menunjukkan bahwa fungsi kosinus memiliki maksimum lokal ketika fungsi sekan memiliki minimum lokal, dan sebaliknya.">
<image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_016.jpg" />
</media></solution>
</exercise></note>
</section><section id="fs-id1232916"><title>Menganalisis Grafik <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> = cot <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis></title><para id="fs-id1585113">Fungsi trigonometri terakhir yang perlu kita jelajahi adalah <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00017">kotangen</term>. Kotangen ditentukan oleh <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00018">identitas resiprokal</term> <m:math>
   <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
     <m:mn>1</m:mn>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:math> Perhatikan bahwa fungsi tersebut tidak terdefinisi ketika fungsi tangennya adalah 0, yang menyebabkan asimtot vertikal pada grafik di <m:math>
   <m:mrow>
   <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:math> dll. Karena keluaran dari fungsi tangen semuanya bilangan real, keluaran dari <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00019">fungsi kotangen</term> juga semuanya bilangan real.</para><para id="fs-id1333454">Kita dapat membuat grafik <m:math>
   <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
  </m:math> dengan mengamati grafik fungsi tangen karena kedua fungsi tersebut saling resiprokal. Lihat <link target-id="Figure_06_02_017" />. Ketika grafik fungsi tangen menurun, grafik fungsi kotangen meningkat. Ketika grafik fungsi tangen meningkat, grafik fungsi kotangen menurun.</para><para id="fs-id1430801">Grafik kotangen mempunyai asimtot vertikal pada setiap nilai <m:math>
   <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
  </m:math> dengan <m:math>
   <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:math> asimtot tersebut ditampilkan pada grafik di bawah sebagai garis putus-putus. Karena kotangen adalah resiprokal tangen, <m:math>
   <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
  </m:math> memiliki asimtot vertikal di semua nilai <m:math>
   <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
  </m:math> dengan <m:math>
   <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
  </m:math> dan <m:math>
   <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow>
  </m:math> di semua nilai <m:math>
   <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
  </m:math> dengan <m:math>
   <m:mrow>
   <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
  </m:math> memiliki asimtot vertikalnya.</para><figure id="Figure_06_02_017" class="small">
   <media id="fs-id942243" alt="Grafik kotangen x, dengan asimtot vertikal pada kelipatan pi.">
    <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_017.jpg" />
   </media>
   <caption>Fungsi kotangen</caption>
  </figure>

  <note id="fs-id1283383"><label>Catatan Umum</label><title>Fitur Grafik <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> = <emphasis effect="italics">A</emphasis>cot(<emphasis effect="italics">Bx</emphasis>)</title>

   <list id="fs-id1393165" list-type="bulleted"><item>Faktor peregangannya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> </item>

    <item>Periodenya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>P</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</item>
    <item>Domainnya adalah <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>k</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:math>  adalah bilangan bulat.</item>
    <item>Range-nya adalah <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mi>∞</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>∞</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Asimtotnya muncul pada <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>k</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:math>  adalah bilangan bulat.</item>
    <item> <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
    </m:math> adalah fungsi ganjil.</item>
   </list></note></section><section id="fs-id1352247"><title>Variasi Grafik dari <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> = cot <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis></title><para id="fs-id1519587">Kita dapat mentransformasi grafik kotangen dengan cara yang hampir sama seperti untuk grafik tangen. Persamaannya menjadi sebagai berikut.</para>
   <equation id="eip-1" class="unnumbered"><label /> <m:math display="block">
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</equation><note id="fs-id1658740"><label>Catatan Umum</label><title>Fitur Grafik <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> = <emphasis effect="italics">A</emphasis>cot(<emphasis effect="italics">Bx</emphasis>−C)+<emphasis effect="italics">D</emphasis></title>
   <list id="eip-id3983675"><item>Faktor peregangannya adalah <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Periodenya adalah <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Domainnya adalah <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>C</m:mi>
                <m:mi>B</m:mi>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dengan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>k</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>  adalah bilangan bulat.</item>
    <item>Range-nya adalah <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>−∞</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>∞</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Asimtot vertikal terjadi pada <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>C</m:mi>
                <m:mi>B</m:mi>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                <m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
                </m:mrow>
            </m:mfrac>
            <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dengan <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>k</m:mi>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math>  adalah bilangan bulat.</item>
<item>Tidak ada amplitudo.</item>
    <item> <m:math>
        <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
        </m:mrow>
    </m:math> adalah fungsi ganjil karena merupakan hasil bagi fungsi genap dan fungsi ganjil (berturut-turut kosinus dan sinus)</item>
</list></note><note id="fs-id1526877" class="how-to-notitle">
   <label>Petunjuk</label>
   <para id="fs-id1674147"><emphasis>Jika diberikan fungsi kotangen termodifikasi berbentuk <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> gambarkan satu periodenya.</emphasis></para><list id="fs-id988921" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic"><item>Nyatakan fungsi dalam bentuk <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Tentukan faktor peregangan, <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Tentukan periode, <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>P</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Gambarlah grafik <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
    </item>
   <item>Plotkan dua titik acuan mana pun.</item>
    <item>Gunakan hubungan resiprokal antara tangen dan kotangen untuk menggambar grafik <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
   <item>Buatlah sketsa asimtotnya.</item>
   </list></note>

  <example id="Example_06_02_08"><exercise id="fs-id918576">
    <problem id="fs-id918578">
        <title>Membuat Grafik Variasi Fungsi Kotangen</title>
        <para id="fs-id1422599">Tentukan faktor peregangan, periode, dan pergeseran fase <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:math> lalu buat sketsa grafiknya.</para>

    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1583359">
        <list id="eip-id1165137777630" list-type="labeled-item"><item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 1.</emphasis> Menuliskan fungsi dalam bentuk <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                        <m:mrow>
                            <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
                        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        </m:math> menghasilkan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                        <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
                        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:math>
            </item>
            <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 2.</emphasis> Faktor peregangannya adalah <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3.</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
                </item>
            <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 3.</emphasis> Periodenya adalah <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>P</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:math>
                </item>
            <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 4.</emphasis> Buat sketsa grafik <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
                </item>
                    <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 5.</emphasis> Plotkan dua titik acuan. Dua titik tersebut adalah <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                            <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                            <m:mrow>
                                <m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mrow>
                        </m:mfrac>
                        <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        </m:math> dan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                            <m:mrow>
                                <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
                            <m:mrow>
                                <m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mrow>
                        </m:mfrac>
                        <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>−3</m:mn></m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:math>
                    </item>
                    <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 6.</emphasis> Gunakan hubungan resiprokal untuk menggambar <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:math>
                        </item>
                    <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 7.</emphasis> Buat sketsa asimtotnya, <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:math>
                    </item>
                  </list><para id="fs-id1377143">Grafik biru di <link target-id="Figure_06_02_019" /> menunjukkan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        </m:math> dan grafik hijau menunjukkan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para>

        <figure id="Figure_06_02_019" class="small">
            <media id="fs-id1702654" alt="Grafik dua periode fungsi tangen termodifikasi dan fungsi kotangen termodifikasi. Asimtot vertikal pada x=-pi/4 dan pi/4.">
                <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_019.jpg" />
            </media>
        </figure>
    </solution>
</exercise>
</example><note id="fs-id1508070" class="how-to-notitle">
   <label>Petunjuk</label>
   <para id="fs-id1692984"><emphasis>Jika diberikan fungsi kotangen termodifikasi berbentuk <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
      <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi></m:mrow>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> gambarkan satu periodenya.</emphasis></para>
   <list id="fs-id1425287" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic"><item>Nyatakan fungsi dalam bentuk <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Tentukan faktor peregangan, <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Tentukan periode, <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>P</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Tentukan pergeseran fase, <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>C</m:mi>
       <m:mi>B</m:mi>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item>Gambarlah grafik <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>  bergeser ke kanan sebesar <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>C</m:mi>
       <m:mi>B</m:mi>
      </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dan ke atas sebesar <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
   <item>Buatlah sketsa asimtotnya <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>C</m:mi>
   <m:mi>B</m:mi>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> dengan <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>k</m:mi>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>  adalah bilangan bulat.
</item>
   <item>Plotkan tiga titik acuan mana pun dan gambarlah grafik yang melalui titik-titik tersebut.</item>
   </list></note>

  <example id="Example_06_02_09"><exercise id="fs-id1700600">
    <problem id="fs-id1700602">
        <title>Membuat Grafik Kotangen yang Dimodifikasi</title>
        <para id="fs-id1690330">Buatlah sketsa grafik satu periode fungsi <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                        <m:mrow>
                            <m:mfrac>
                                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                                <m:mn>8</m:mn>
                            </m:mfrac>
                            <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                            </m:mfrac>
                        </m:mrow>
                        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2.</m:mn></m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1356223">
        <list id="eip-id1165134038202" list-type="labeled-item"><item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 1.</emphasis> Fungsi tersebut sudah ditulis dalam bentuk umum <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                        <m:mrow>
                            <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi></m:mrow>
                        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </item>
        <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 2.</emphasis> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:math> sehingga faktor peregangannya adalah 4.</item>
        <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 3.</emphasis> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>8</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:math> jadi periodenya adalah <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>P</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>B</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow>
                    </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                            <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                            <m:mn>8</m:mn>
                        </m:mfrac>

                    </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>8.</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </item>
            <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 4.</emphasis> <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>C</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:math> jadi pergeseran fasenya adalah <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mfrac>
                    <m:mi>C</m:mi>
                    <m:mi>B</m:mi>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                            <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:mfrac>

                    </m:mrow>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                            <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                            <m:mn>8</m:mn>
                        </m:mfrac>

                    </m:mrow>
                </m:mfrac>
                <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4.</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
        </m:math>
            </item>
            <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 5.</emphasis> Kita menggambar <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                        <m:mrow>
                            <m:mfrac>
                                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                                <m:mn>8</m:mn>
                            </m:mfrac>
                            <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                            </m:mfrac>
                        </m:mrow>
                        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2.</m:mn></m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </item>
        <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 6-7.</emphasis> Tiga titik yang dapat kita gunakan untuk memandu grafik adalah <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:math> dan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
        </m:math> Kita menggunakan hubungan resiprokal tangen dan kotangen untuk menggambar <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                        <m:mrow>
                            <m:mfrac>
                                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                                <m:mn>8</m:mn>
                            </m:mfrac>
                            <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
                                <m:mi>π</m:mi>
                                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                            </m:mfrac>
                        </m:mrow>
                        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2.</m:mn></m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </item>
        <item><emphasis effect="italics">Langkah 8.</emphasis> Asimtot vertikalnya adalah <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow>
        </m:math> dan <m:math>
            <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12.</m:mn></m:mrow>
        </m:math>
        </item>
            </list><para id="fs-id1445913">Grafiknya ditunjukkan pada <link target-id="Figure_06_02_020" />.</para>

        <figure id="Figure_06_02_020" class="small"><media id="fs-id1404816" alt="Grafik satu periode dari fungsi kotangen yang dimodifikasi. Asimtot vertikal pada x=4 dan x=12.">
            <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_020.jpg" />
        </media>

            <caption>Satu periode dari fungsi kotangen yang dimodifikasi</caption></figure></solution>
</exercise>
</example></section><section id="fs-id1461208">
  <title>Menggunakan Grafik Fungsi Trigonometri untuk Menyelesaikan Masalah Dunia Nyata</title>
  <para id="fs-id1370674">Banyak situasi dunia nyata menyatakan fungsi periodik dan dapat dimodelkan dengan fungsi trigonometri. Sebagai contoh, mari kembali ke skenario pembuka bagian. Pernahkah Anda mengamati berkas yang dihasilkan lampu berputar pada mobil pemadam dan bertanya-tanya tentang gerak berkas itu pada dinding? Sifat periodik jarak yang ditempuh cahaya sebagai fungsi waktu tampak jelas, tetapi bagaimana jarak itu ditentukan? Kita dapat menggunakan <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00020">fungsi tangen</term>.</para><example id="Example_06_02_10">
   <exercise id="fs-id1270016">
    <problem id="fs-id1270018">
     <title>Menggunakan Fungsi Trigonometri untuk Menyelesaikan Skenario Dunia Nyata</title>
     <para id="fs-id1535059">Misalkan fungsi <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>4</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>t</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math> menandai jarak pergerakan berkas cahaya dari atas mobil polisi melintasi dinding tempat <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>t</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math> adalah waktu dalam detik dan <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math> adalah jarak dalam kaki dari suatu titik di dinding tepat di seberang mobil polisi.</para>
     <list id="fs-id1526727" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Tentukan dan tafsirkan faktor peregangan dan periodenya.</item>
      <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Grafik pada interval <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
      </m:math>
      </item>
      <item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> Hitung <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
      </m:math> dan bahas nilai fungsi pada masukan tersebut.</item>
     </list></problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1658185">


    <list id="fs-id1658187" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Dari bentuk umum <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>t</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math> kita mengetahui bahwa <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math> adalah faktor peregangan dan <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
        <m:mi>B</m:mi>
       </m:mfrac>
       </m:mrow>
     </m:math> adalah periodenya.
    <figure id="Image_06_02_022" class="small">
     <media id="fs-id1653469" alt="Grafik yang menunjukkan bahwa variabel A adalah koefisien fungsi tangen dan variabel B adalah koefisien x yang berada di dalam fungsi tangen tersebut.">
      <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_022.jpg" />
     </media>
    </figure>
    <para id="fs-id887356">Faktor peregangan vertikal 5 berarti berkas telah bergerak 5 kaki dalam seperempat periode sebelum atau sesudah tanda setengah periode. Hal ini bersesuaian dengan nilai y fungsi tangen standar yang bernilai 1 pada jarak seperempat periode dari pusat periode, dikalikan faktor peregangan 5.</para>
      <para id="fs-id1651541">Periodenya adalah <m:math>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>π</m:mi>
           <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
         </m:mrow>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>⋅</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>4</m:mn>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4.</m:mn></m:mrow>
      </m:math> Artinya setiap 4 detik, berkas cahaya menyapu dinding. Jarak dari tempat di seberang mobil polisi semakin besar seiring mendekatnya mobil polisi.</para>
     </item>
     <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Untuk membuat grafik fungsi, kita menggambar asimtot di <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>t</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow>
     </m:math> dan gunakan faktor peregangan serta periodenya. Lihat <link target-id="Image_06_02_021" />
     <figure id="Image_06_02_021" class="small"><media id="fs-id1451826" alt="Grafik satu periode dari fungsi tangen yang dimodifikasi, dengan asimtot vertikal di x=4.">
       <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_021n.jpg" />
      </media>
     </figure></item>
     <item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> periode: <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>4</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
         <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> setelah 1 detik, sinar telah berpindah 5 kaki dari titik di seberang mobil polisi.</item>
    </list></solution>
   </exercise>
  </example>

  <note id="fs-id1701460" class="precalculus media media-notitle">
   <label>Fitur Media</label>
   <para id="fs-id1516989">Akses sumber daya online ini untuk instruksi tambahan dan latihan dengan grafik fungsi trigonometri lainnya.</para>
   <list id="fs-id1526866">
    <item><link url="https://openstax.org/l/graphtangent">Membuat Grafik Tangen</link></item>
   <item><link url="https://openstax.org/l/graphcscsec">Membuat Grafik Kosekan dan Sekan</link></item>
   <item><link url="https://openstax.org/l/graphcot">Membuat Grafik Kotangen</link></item>
   </list>
  </note>
 </section>

<section id="fs-id1526416" class="key-equations"><title>Persamaan Utama</title><table id="eip-id1165133401597" summary=".." class="unnumbered unstyled"><label />
<tgroup cols="2"><colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
        <colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
        <tbody>
            <row>
                <entry>Fungsi tangen yang digeser, dimampatkan, dan/atau diregangkan</entry>
                <entry> <m:math>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                            <m:mrow>
                                <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
                            </m:mrow>
                            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                </m:math>
                </entry>
            </row>


            <row>
                <entry>fungsi sekan yang digeser, dimampatkan, dan/atau diregangkan</entry>
                <entry> <m:math>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                            <m:mrow>
                                <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
                            </m:mrow>
                            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                </m:math>
                </entry>
            </row>
            <row>
                <entry>Fungsi kosekan yang digeser, dimampatkan, dan/atau diregangkan</entry>
                <entry> <m:math>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                            <m:mrow>
                                <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
                            </m:mrow>
                            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                </m:math>
                </entry>
            </row>
<row>
                <entry>Fungsi kotangen yang digeser, dimampatkan, dan/atau diregangkan</entry>
                <entry> <m:math>
                    <m:mrow>
                        <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
                            <m:mrow>
                                <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi>
                            </m:mrow>
                            <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                </m:math>
                </entry>
            </row>
        </tbody>

</tgroup>
</table></section><section id="fs-id1693998" class="key-concepts">
  	<title>Konsep Utama</title><list id="fs-id1651799"><item>Fungsi tangen memiliki periode <m:math>
  	  <m:mrow>
  	   <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
  	 </m:math>
  	 </item>
  	 <item> <m:math>
  	  <m:mrow>
  	   <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
  	    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  	    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
  	     <m:mrow>
  	      <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi></m:mrow>
  	     <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi></m:mrow>
  	 </m:math> merupakan fungsi tangen dengan peregangan/pemampatan dan pergeseran vertikal dan/atau horizontal. Lihat <link target-id="Example_06_02_01" />, <link target-id="Example_06_02_02" />, dan <link target-id="Example_06_02_03" />.</item>
  	 <item>Sekan dan kosekan keduanya merupakan fungsi periodik dengan periode <m:math>
  	  <m:mrow>
  	   <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
  	 </m:math> <m:math>
  	  <m:mrow>
  	   <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
  	    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  	    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
  	     <m:mrow>
  	      <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi></m:mrow>
  	     <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi></m:mrow>
  	 </m:math> memberikan grafik fungsi sekan yang digeser, dimampatkan, dan/atau diregangkan. Lihat <link target-id="Example_06_02_04" /> dan <link target-id="Example_06_02_05" />.</item>
  	 <item> <m:math>
  	  <m:mrow>
  	   <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
  	    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  	    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
  	     <m:mrow>
  	      <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi></m:mrow>
  	     <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi></m:mrow>
  	 </m:math> memberikan grafik fungsi kosekan yang digeser, dimampatkan, dan/atau diregangkan. Lihat <link target-id="Example_06_02_06" /> dan <link target-id="Example_06_02_07" />.</item>
  	 <item>Fungsi kotangen memiliki periode <m:math>
  	  <m:mrow>
  	   <m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
  	 </m:math> dan asimtot vertikal di <m:math>
  	  <m:mrow>
  	   <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>...</m:mn></m:mrow>
  	 </m:math>
  	 </item>
  	 <item>range kotangen adalah <m:math>
  	  <m:mrow>
  	   <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
  	    <m:mrow>
  	     <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>∞</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>∞</m:mi></m:mrow>
  	    <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
  	 </m:math> dan fungsinya menurun di setiap titik dalam rentangnya.</item>
  	 <item>Kotangen bernilai nol pada <m:math>
  	  <m:mrow>
  	   <m:mo>±</m:mo><m:mfrac>
  	    <m:mi>π</m:mi>
  	    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  	   </m:mfrac>
  	   <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mo>±</m:mo><m:mfrac>
  	    <m:mrow>
  	     <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
  	    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  	   </m:mfrac>
  	   <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>...</m:mn></m:mrow>
  	 </m:math>
  	 </item>
  	 <item> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mi>x</m:mi>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>B</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>C</m:mi></m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>D</m:mi></m:mrow>
</m:math> adalah kotangen dengan peregangan/pemampatan dan pergeseran vertikal dan/atau horizontal. Lihat <link target-id="Example_06_02_08" /> dan <link target-id="Example_06_02_09" />.</item>
  	 <item>Skenario dunia nyata dapat diselesaikan menggunakan grafik fungsi trigonometri. Lihat <link target-id="Example_06_02_10" />.</item>
  	</list></section>

 <section id="fs-id878869" class="section-exercises">

  <title>Latihan Bagian</title><section id="fs-id878873">
   <title>Verbal</title>
   <exercise id="fs-id1407115">
    <problem id="fs-id1407118"><para id="fs-id1407119">Jelaskan bagaimana grafik fungsi sinus dapat digunakan untuk membuat grafik <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </para></problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1439605">
    <para id="fs-id1439607">Karena <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:math> adalah fungsi resiprokal dari <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math> Anda dapat memplot resiprokal koordinat-koordinat pada grafik <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:math> untuk memperoleh koordinat <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> dari <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math> Titik potong sumbu <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> pada grafik <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:math> adalah asimtot vertikal untuk grafik <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </para></solution>
   </exercise>

   <exercise id="fs-id1513360">
    <problem id="fs-id1513362">
     <para id="fs-id1454682">Bagaimana grafik <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math> digunakan untuk membuat grafik <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1421392">
    <problem id="fs-id1421394">
     <para id="fs-id1421396">Jelaskan mengapa periode <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math> sama dengan <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1461031">
    <para id="fs-id1461033">Jawaban dapat bervariasi. Dengan lingkaran satuan, dapat ditunjukkan bahwa <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </para></solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1409386">
    <problem id="fs-id1409388">
     <para id="fs-id1351021">Mengapa tidak ada intersep pada grafik <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1529165">
    <problem id="fs-id1529167">
     <para id="fs-id1529169">Bagaimana periode <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math> dibandingkan dengan periode <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1365330">
    <para id="fs-id1365332">Periodenya sama: <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </para>
   </solution>
   </exercise>

  </section>
  <section id="fs-id1608979"><title>Aljabar</title><para id="fs-id1608984">Untuk latihan berikut, cocokkan setiap fungsi trigonometri dengan salah satu grafik berikut.</para>
<figure id="fs-idm479076032">
<media id="Figure_06_02_201combined" alt="Gambar menampilkan empat grafik berbeda, masing-masing berlabel angka Romawi dan mewakili sebuah fungsi trigonometri. Grafik I menunjukkan fungsi tangen, y = tan(x), berupa kurva-kurva naik yang melalui titik asal dan memiliki asimtot vertikal pada x = ±π/2. Grafik II menunjukkan fungsi kosekan, y = csc(x), dengan cabang berbentuk U yang terbuka ke atas dan ke bawah serta asimtot vertikal pada kelipatan bulat π, misalnya x = π. Grafik III menunjukkan fungsi kotangen, y = cot(x), berupa kurva-kurva turun yang memotong sumbu x pada x = π/2 dan memiliki asimtot vertikal pada kelipatan bulat π. Grafik IV menunjukkan fungsi sekan, y = sec(x), juga dengan cabang berbentuk U yang terbuka ke atas dan ke bawah serta asimtot vertikal pada kelipatan ganjil π/2, misalnya x = π/2 dan x = 3π/2.">
     <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_201combined.jpg" />
    </media>
</figure>

<exercise id="fs-id1600438">
    <problem id="fs-id1600440">
     <para id="fs-id1600443"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1402861">
    <problem id="fs-id1402863">
     <para id="fs-id1402865"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1583599">
    <para id="fs-id1512360"> IV</para>
   </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1512365">
    <problem id="fs-id1451983">
     <para id="fs-id1451985"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1434924">
    <problem id="fs-id1434926">
     <para id="fs-id1673834"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1410900">
     <para id="fs-id1410903"> III</para>
    </solution>
   </exercise>

   <para id="fs-id1365640">Untuk latihan berikut, tentukan periode dan pergeseran horizontal dari masing-masing fungsi.</para>
   <exercise id="fs-id1365643">
    <problem id="fs-id1365645">
     <para id="fs-id1562031"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>32</m:mn></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1662387">
    <problem id="fs-id1662389">
     <para id="fs-id1671047"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>h</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>π</m:mi>
           <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
           <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1581683">
    <para id="fs-id1581685">periode: 8; pergeseran horizontal: 1 satuan ke kiri </para>
   </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1405674">
    <problem id="fs-id1405676">
     <para id="fs-id1405678"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>m</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>π</m:mi>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>

   <para id="para-00002">Untuk latihan berikut, evaluasi fungsi yang diubah.</para>
   <exercise id="fs-id1652255">
    <problem id="fs-id1652257">
     <para id="fs-id1652259">Jika <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>1.5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> tentukan <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1429262">
    <para id="fs-id1429264"> 1.5</para>
   </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1422443">
    <problem id="fs-id1422445">
     <para id="fs-id1422447">Jika <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> tentukan <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1356505">
    <problem id="fs-id1456034">
     <para id="fs-id1456037">Jika <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> tentukan <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1375605">
    <para id="fs-id1375607"> 5</para>
   </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1404272">
    <problem id="fs-id1404274">
     <para id="fs-id1428797">Jika <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> tentukan <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
   </exercise>

   <para id="fs-id1508271">Untuk latihan berikut, tulis ulang setiap ekspresi sehingga argumen <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
   </m:math> positif.</para>
   <exercise id="fs-id1351072">
    <problem id="fs-id1351074">
     <para id="fs-id1351076"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1407071">
    <para id="fs-id1407073"> <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </para>
   </solution>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1458413">
    <problem id="fs-id1458415">
     <para id="fs-id1458417"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>cos</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>

  </section><section id="fs-id1513346">
   <title>Grafis</title>
   <para id="fs-id1283129">Untuk latihan berikut, buat sketsa dua periode grafik setiap fungsi. Tentukan faktor peregangan, periode, dan asimtotnya.</para>
   <exercise id="fs-id1283134"><problem id="fs-id1434575">
     <para id="fs-id1434577"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>32</m:mn></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1570678">

    <media id="fs-id1644075" alt="Grafik dua periode dari fungsi tangen yang dimodifikasi. Ada dua asimtot vertikal.">
     <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_202.jpg" />
    </media>

    <para id="fs-id1656875">faktor peregangan: 2; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> asimtot: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
     <m:mi>π</m:mi>
     <m:mn>2</m:mn>
    </m:mfrac>
    <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>k</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
  <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext> dengan </m:mtext><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mtext> adalah bilangan bulat</m:mtext>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></solution>
   </exercise><exercise id="fs-id1422233">
    <problem id="fs-id1422235">
     <para id="fs-id1422238"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>h</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>π</m:mi>
           <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
           <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1435841"><problem id="fs-id1419768">
     <para id="fs-id1419770"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>m</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>π</m:mi>
           <m:mn>3</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1366142">

    <media id="fs-id1375745" alt="Grafik dua periode fungsi kosekan yang dimodifikasi. Asimtot vertikal pada x= -6, -3, 0, 3, dan 6.">
     <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_204.jpg" />
    </media>

    <para id="fs-id1512258">faktor peregangan: 6; periode: 6; asimtot: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext> dengan </m:mtext><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mtext> adalah bilangan bulat</m:mtext>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></solution>
   </exercise><exercise id="fs-id1562828">
    <problem id="fs-id1562830">
     <para id="fs-id1562832"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>j</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>π</m:mi>
           <m:mn>2</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1581814"><problem id="fs-id1581816">
     <para id="fs-id1581818"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>p</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1439706">

    <media id="fs-id1365984" alt="Grafik dua periode dari fungsi tangen yang dimodifikasi. Asimtot vertikal pada kelipatan pi.">
     <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_206.jpg" />
    </media>

    <para id="fs-id1419808">faktor peregangan: 1; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> asimtot: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext> dengan </m:mtext><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mtext> adalah bilangan bulat</m:mtext>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></solution>
   </exercise><exercise id="fs-id1385170">
    <problem id="fs-id1385172">
     <para id="fs-id1385174"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1506812"><problem id="fs-id1506814">
     <para id="fs-id1506816"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>4</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1354976">

    <media id="fs-id1354983" alt="Grafik dua periode dari fungsi tangen yang dimodifikasi. Tiga asimtot vertikal ditampilkan.">
     <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_208.jpg" />
    </media>

    <para id="fs-id1528080">faktor peregangan: 1; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> asimtot: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext> dengan </m:mtext><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mtext> adalah bilangan bulat</m:mtext>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></solution>
   </exercise><exercise id="fs-id1364876">
    <problem id="fs-id1364878">
     <para id="fs-id1364880"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1506136"><problem id="fs-id1655270">
     <para id="fs-id1655272"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mi>x</m:mi>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1429724">

      <media id="fs-id1455973" alt="Grafik dua periode dari fungsi kosekan yang dimodifikasi. Asimtot vertikal pada kelipatan pi.">
       <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_210.jpg" />
      </media>

     <para id="fs-id1489928">faktor peregangan: 2; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> asimtot: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext> dengan </m:mtext><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mtext> adalah bilangan bulat</m:mtext>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
 </para></solution>
   </exercise><exercise id="fs-id1402973">
    <problem id="fs-id1402975">
     <para id="fs-id1405719"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mn>1</m:mn>
         <m:mn>4</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1699640"><problem id="fs-id1408399">
     <para id="fs-id1408401"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1704364">

      <media id="fs-id1704371" alt="Grafik dua periode dari fungsi sekan yang dimodifikasi. Asimtot vertikal pada x=-pi/2, -pi/6, pi/6, dan pi/2.">
       <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_212.jpg" />
      </media>

     <para id="fs-id1583862">faktor peregangan: 4; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>3</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> asimtot: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>6</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext> dengan </m:mtext><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mtext> adalah bilangan bulat ganjil</m:mtext>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></solution>
   </exercise><exercise id="fs-id1705843">
    <problem id="fs-id1705846">
     <para id="fs-id1705848"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1375944"><problem id="fs-id1420097">
     <para id="fs-id1420099"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1429972">

      <media id="fs-id1429978" alt="Grafik dua periode dari fungsi sekan yang dimodifikasi. Ada empat asimtot vertikal yang semuanya terpisah pi/5.">
       <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_214.jpg" />
      </media>

     <para id="fs-id1582375">faktor peregangan: 7; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi>
   </m:mrow>
   <m:mn>5</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> asimtot: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mrow>
    <m:mn>10</m:mn>
   </m:mrow>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext> dengan </m:mtext><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mtext> adalah bilangan bulat ganjil</m:mtext>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></solution>
   </exercise><exercise id="fs-id1655075">
    <problem id="fs-id1655077">
     <para id="fs-id1417308"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
        <m:mn>9</m:mn>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1523811"><problem id="fs-id1523813">
     <para id="fs-id1523815"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>4</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1404596">

      <media id="fs-id1404603" alt="Grafik dua periode dari fungsi kosekan yang dimodifikasi. Tiga asimtot vertikal, masing-masing pi terpisah.">
       <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_216.jpg" />
      </media>

     <para id="fs-id1361638">faktor peregangan: 2; periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> asimtot: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext> dengan </m:mtext><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mtext> adalah bilangan bulat</m:mtext>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></solution>
   </exercise><exercise id="fs-id1434375">
    <problem id="fs-id1434377">
     <para id="fs-id1434379"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>3</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1614813"><problem id="fs-id1614815">
     <para id="fs-id1614818"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
        <m:mn>7</m:mn>
        <m:mn>5</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mn>4</m:mn>
         </m:mfrac>
        </m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1392291">

      <media id="fs-id1446559" alt="Grafik fungsi kosekan yang dimodifikasi. Empat asimtot vertikal.">
       <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_218.jpg" />
      </media>

     <para id="fs-id1375388">faktor peregangan: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>7</m:mn>
   <m:mn>5</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> periode: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mo>;</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math> asimtot: <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mi>π</m:mi>
   <m:mn>4</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext> dengan </m:mtext><m:mi>k</m:mi><m:mtext> adalah bilangan bulat</m:mtext>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></solution>
   </exercise><exercise id="fs-id1409971">
    <problem id="fs-id1409974">
     <para id="fs-id1409976"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac>
            <m:mi>π</m:mi>
            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
           </m:mfrac>
          </m:mrow>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>

   <para id="fs-id1464121">Untuk latihan berikut, tentukan dan gambarkan dua periode fungsi periodik dengan faktor peregangan yang diberikan, <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
  <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>A</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math> periode, dan pergeseran fase.</para>
   <exercise id="fs-id1649329" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1649331">
     <para id="fs-id1649334">Kurva tangen, <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> periode <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
        <m:mn>3</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
       <m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> dan pergeseran fase <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>h</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>k</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>π</m:mi>
           <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1694856"><para id="fs-id1694857"> <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>π</m:mi>
           <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
         </m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </para>

    <media id="fs-id1649707" alt="Grafik dua periode dari fungsi tangen yang dimodifikasi. Asimtot vertikal pada x=-pi/4 dan pi/12.">
     <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_220.jpg" />
    </media>

    </solution>
   </exercise><exercise id="fs-id1658055" class="material-set-2">
    <problem id="fs-id1440828">
     <para id="fs-id1440830">Kurva tangen, <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>A</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>−2</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> periode <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
        <m:mn>4</m:mn>
       </m:mfrac>
       <m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> dan pergeseran fase <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>h</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>k</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>π</m:mi>
           <m:mn>4</m:mn>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mn>−2</m:mn></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para></problem>
   </exercise>

   <para id="fs-id1588386">Untuk latihan berikut, carilah persamaan grafik setiap fungsi.</para>
   <exercise id="fs-id1588389" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1588390">
    <media id="fs-id1513948" alt="Grafik dua periode fungsi kosekan yang dimodifikasi, dengan asimtot kelipatan pi/2.">
     <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_222.jpg" />
    </media>
 </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1706413"><para id="fs-id1706414"> <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="fs-id1464236" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1464237">

   	 <media id="fs-id1537949" alt="Grafik fungsi kotangen yang dimodifikasi. Asimtot vertikal pada x=-1 dan x=0 dan x=1.">
     <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_223.jpg" />
    </media>
</problem></exercise><exercise id="fs-id1409010" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1409012">
    <media id="fs-id1409017" alt="Grafik fungsi kosekan yang dimodifikasi. Asimtot vertikal pada kelipatan pi/4.">
     <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_224.jpg" />
    </media>
</problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1649185"><para id="fs-id1405484"> <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="fs-id1465129" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1465130">

    <media id="fs-id1465137" alt="Grafik fungsi tangen yang dimodifikasi. Asimtot vertikal pada -pi/8 dan 3pi/8.">
     <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_225.jpg" />
    </media>
</problem></exercise><exercise id="fs-id1653766" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1653767">

    <media id="fs-id1445558" alt="Grafik fungsi kosekan yang dimodifikasi. Asimtot vertikal pada kelipatan pi.">
     <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_226.jpg" />
    </media>
</problem>
    <solution id="fs-id705620"><para id="fs-id705621"> <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="fs-id1530295" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1530296">
    <media id="fs-id1695827" alt="Grafik fungsi sekan yang dimodifikasi. Empat asimtot vertikal.">
     <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_227.jpg" />
    </media>
</problem></exercise><exercise id="fs-id1664599" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1664600">

    <media id="fs-id1664606" alt="Grafik dua periode fungsi tangen yang dimodifikasi. Asimtot vertikal pada x=-0.005 dan x=0.005.">
     <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_228.jpg" />
    </media>
</problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1432037"><para id="fs-id1460872"> <m:math>
 <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
   <m:mn>1</m:mn>
   <m:mn>2</m:mn>
  </m:mfrac>
  <m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>100</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
 </m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></solution></exercise></section>
  <section id="fs-id1678301">
   <title>Teknologi</title>
   <para id="fs-id1678306">Untuk latihan berikut, gunakan kalkulator grafik untuk membuat grafik dua periode dari fungsi yang diberikan. Catatan: sebagian besar kalkulator grafik tidak memiliki tombol kosekan; oleh karena itu, Anda perlu memasukkan <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
  <m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
   </m:math> sebagai <m:math>
    <m:mrow>
  <m:mfrac>
      <m:mn>1</m:mn>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>sin</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:mfrac>
     <m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
   </m:math>
   </para><exercise id="fs-id1691184">
    <problem id="fs-id1691186">
     <para id="fs-id1691188"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mi>x</m:mi>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1690901"><problem id="fs-id1447025">
     <para id="fs-id1447027"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mrow>
        <m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mi>x</m:mi>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1656302">

    <media id="fs-id1656308" alt="Grafik nilai absolut fungsi kotangen. Rentangnya adalah 0 hingga tak terhingga.">
     <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_230.jpg" />
    </media>

   </solution>
   </exercise><exercise id="fs-id1699978">
    <problem id="fs-id1699980">
     <para id="fs-id1699982"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
       </m:msup>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1697409"><problem id="fs-id1697411">
     <para id="fs-id1451630"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
          <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
       </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1420323">
<media id="fs-id1420330" alt="Grafik tangen x.">
       <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_232.jpg" />
      </media>
</solution>
   </exercise><exercise id="fs-id1521332">
    <problem id="fs-id1586756">
     <para id="fs-id1586758">Gambarkan grafik <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sec</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msup>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mi>tan</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:msup>
       <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> Apa fungsi yang ditunjukkan pada grafik?</para></problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1600902"><problem id="fs-id1600904">
     <para id="fs-id1600906"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>0.001</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1586275">


      <media id="fs-id1586282" alt="Grafik dua periode dari fungsi sekan yang dimodifikasi. Asimtot vertikal pada kelipatan 500pi.">
     <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_234.jpg" />
    </media>


   </solution>
   </exercise><exercise id="fs-id1432442">
    <problem id="fs-id1432444">
     <para id="fs-id1671603"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>cot</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>100</m:mn><m:mi>π</m:mi><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
   </exercise>
   <exercise id="fs-id1536091"><problem id="fs-id1536094">
     <para id="fs-id1536096"> <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
       <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>sin</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mi>cos</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
       </m:msup>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
    </problem>
    <solution id="fs-id1631004">
<media id="fs-id1631010" alt="Grafik yang menunjukkan garis biru horizontal di y=1 pada sistem koordinat Kartesius. Sumbu x diberi label kelipatan pi/2, dan sumbu y diberi label bilangan bulat dari -2 hingga 2.">
       <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_241.jpg" />
      </media>
</solution>
   </exercise></section>
  <section id="fs-id1526988">
   <title>Penerapan Dunia Nyata</title>
   <exercise id="fs-id1526993" class="material-set-2">
    <problem id="fs-id1526995">
     <para id="fs-id1405403">Fungsi <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>20</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>π</m:mi>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
     </m:math> menandai jarak pergerakan berkas cahaya dari mobil polisi melintasi dinding dalam waktu <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> dalam hitungan detik, dan jarak <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
      dalam satuan kaki.</para>
   <list id="fs-id1384936" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled">
    <item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Grafik pada interval <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
       <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
   <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Tentukan dan tafsirkan faktor peregangan, periode, dan asimtotnya.</item>
    <item><span class="token">ⓒ</span>	Hitung <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mn>1</m:mn>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
    </m:math> dan <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>2.5</m:mn></m:mrow>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
    </m:math> dan bahas nilai fungsi pada masukan-masukan tersebut.</item>
   </list>
   </problem>
   </exercise>

   <exercise id="fs-id1513694" class="material-set-2"><problem id="fs-id1513696">
     <para id="fs-id1513698">Seorang nelayan yang berdiri di tepi danau melihat sebuah perahu jauh di sebelah kirinya. Misalkan <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> diukur dalam radian, yaitu sudut yang dibentuk oleh garis pandang kapal dan garis ke arah utara dari posisinya. Asumsikan arah utara adalah 0 dan <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math> diukur negatif ke kiri dan positif ke kanan. (Lihat <link target-id="Figure_06_02_237" />.) Perahu bergerak dari arah barat ke timur dan, dengan mengabaikan kelengkungan bumi, jaraknya <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>d</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> dari nelayan ke perahu, dalam kilometer, diberikan oleh fungsi <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>d</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1.5</m:mn><m:mi>sec</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mi>x</m:mi>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para>
   <list id="fs-id1434023" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled">
    <item><span class="token">ⓐ</span>Apakah domain yang wajar untuk <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>d</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span>Gambarkan grafik <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>d</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
    </m:math> di domain ini.</item>
    <item><span class="token">ⓒ</span>Temukan dan diskusikan arti dari setiap asimtot vertikal pada grafik <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>d</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item><span class="token">ⓓ</span>Hitung dan tafsirkan <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>d</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>3</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math> Bulatkan hingga dua tempat desimal.</item>
    <item><span class="token">ⓔ</span>Hitung dan tafsirkan <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>d</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>6</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math> Bulatkan hingga dua tempat desimal.</item>
   <item><span class="token">ⓕ</span>Berapa jarak minimum antara nelayan dan perahu? Kapan hal ini terjadi?</item>
   </list>

   <figure id="Figure_06_02_237" class="medium">
    <media id="fs-id1420140" alt="Ilustrasi seorang pria dan jaraknya dari perahu.">
     <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_237.jpg" />
    </media>
   </figure>
    </problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1700715">
   <list id="fs-id1700717" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
        <m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>π</m:mi>
         <m:mn>2</m:mn>
        </m:mfrac>
       </m:mrow>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
   <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span>
    <media id="fs-id1532106" alt="Grafik setengah periode fungsi sekan. Asimtot vertikal pada x=-pi/2 dan pi/2.">
     <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_238.jpg" />
    </media>
</item>
    <item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> dan <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math> jaraknya bertambah tanpa batas <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>|</m:mo> <m:mi>x</m:mi> <m:mo>|</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
    </m:math> mendekat <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>2</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      </m:mrow>
    </m:math> —yakni, pada sudut siku-siku terhadap garis yang menunjukkan arah utara, perahu akan berada begitu jauh sehingga nelayan tidak dapat melihatnya;</item>
    <item><span class="token">ⓓ</span>3; ketika <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>3</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math> perahu berjarak 3 km;</item>
    <item><span class="token">ⓔ</span>	1.73; ketika <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>π</m:mi>
       <m:mn>6</m:mn>
      </m:mfrac>
      <m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math> perahu berjarak sekitar 1.73 km;</item>
    <item><span class="token">ⓕ</span> 1.5 km; ketika <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
   </list></solution></exercise><exercise id="fs-id1431336" class="material-set-2">
    <problem id="fs-id1431338">
     <para id="fs-id1431340">Pengukur jarak laser mengunci sebuah komet yang mendekati Bumi. Jarak <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math> komet setelah <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math> hari, untuk <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math> dalam interval 0 hingga 30 hari, diberikan oleh <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>250,000</m:mn><m:mi>csc</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
         <m:mrow>
          <m:mfrac>
           <m:mi>π</m:mi>
           <m:mrow>
            <m:mn>30</m:mn></m:mrow>
          </m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
         <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para><list id="fs-id1526530" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled">
    <item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Gambarkan grafik <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
    </m:math> pada interval <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo> <m:mrow>
       <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mn>30</m:mn></m:mrow> <m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Hitung <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mn>5</m:mn>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
     dan tafsirkan informasinya.</item>
   <item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> Berapa jarak minimum antara komet dan Bumi? Kapan hal ini terjadi? Konstanta manakah dalam persamaan yang berhubungan dengan hal ini?</item>
   <item><span class="token">ⓓ</span> Temukan dan diskusikan arti dari setiap asimtot vertikal.</item>
   </list>
    </problem>
   </exercise>

   <exercise id="fs-id1601867" class="material-set-2">
    <problem id="fs-id1601869">
     <para id="fs-id1422576">Sebuah kamera video diarahkan pada roket di landasan peluncuran yang berjarak 2 mil dari kamera. Sudut elevasi dari tanah ke roket setelah <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
     </m:math> detik adalah <m:math>
      <m:mrow>
    <m:mfrac>
        <m:mi>π</m:mi>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mn>120</m:mn></m:mrow>
       </m:mfrac>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
     </m:math>
     </para><list id="fs-id1614554" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span>Tulis fungsi yang menyatakan ketinggian <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>h</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math> roket di atas tanah, dalam mil, setelah <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:math> detik. Abaikan kelengkungan bumi.</item>
    <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span>Gambarkan grafik <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>h</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
    </m:math> pada interval <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mn>60</m:mn></m:mrow>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item><span class="token">ⓒ</span>Hitung dan tafsirkan nilai <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>h</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mn>0</m:mn>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
    </m:math> dan <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>h</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>30</m:mn></m:mrow>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
    <item><span class="token">ⓓ</span>Apa yang terjadi pada nilai <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>h</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
    </m:math> ketika <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
     mendekati 60 detik? Tafsirkan makna ini dari sudut pandang masalahnya.</item>
   </list></problem>
   <solution id="fs-id1523904">
   <list id="fs-id1523906" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>h</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>tan</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
        <m:mrow>
         <m:mfrac>
          <m:mi>π</m:mi>
          <m:mrow>
           <m:mn>120</m:mn></m:mrow>
         </m:mfrac>
         <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
        <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>;</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math>
    </item>
   <item><span class="token">ⓑ</span>
    <media id="fs-id1601972" alt="Fungsi yang meningkat secara eksponensial dengan asimtot vertikal di x=60.">
     <image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_Precalc_Figure_06_02_240.jpg" />
    </media>
</item>
    <item><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>h</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mn>0</m:mn>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>:</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math> setelah 0 detik, roket berada 0 mil di atas tanah; <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
      <m:mi>h</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mrow>
        <m:mn>30</m:mn></m:mrow>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>:</m:mo></m:mrow>
    </m:math> setelah 30 detik, tinggi roket mencapai 2 mil;</item>
    <item><span class="token">ⓓ</span>Ketika <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow>
    </m:math> mendekati 60 detik, nilai <m:math>
     <m:mrow>
 <m:mi>h</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo>
       <m:mi>x</m:mi>
       <m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow>
    </m:math> tumbuh semakin besar. Jarak ke roket semakin jauh sehingga kamera tidak dapat lagi melacaknya.</item>
   </list></solution>
   </exercise>
  </section>
 </section>

